TC_FACEBOOK_REG_001

Title: Verify registration with valid credentials

Preconditions:
	•	User is not logged in
	•	Sign up page is opened

Test Data:
	•	Name: Gokhan
	•	Last Name: Ergucel
	•	Birthdate: 01/01/2000
	•	Email: test@mail.com
	•	Password: Test@123

Test Steps:
	1.	Enter a valid name
	2.	Enter a valid last name
	3.	Enter a valid birthday
	4.	Enter a valid gender
	5.	Enter a valid phone number or email
	6.	Enter a valid password
	7.	Click the Sign Up button

Expected Result:
User is redirected to email or phone number verification page

Actual Result:
Email or phone number verification page opened

Priority: High
Severity: Critical
Status: Passed



